            "description": {
              "value": "When you attempt to Demoralize, you can make it harder for the target to flee, in place of the action's normal effects.\n\n- **Critical Success:** For 1 round, the target takes a –10-foot status penalty to Speed and a –4 status penalty to Stealth.\n- **Success:** For 1 round, the target takes a –5-foot status penalty to Speed and a –2 status penalty to Stealth."
            }
